title: "Rarámuri Histórico Digital — Corpus Steffel 1791/1809"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-15
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: Sandoval Gutierrez
    given-names: Fernando
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3168-6725"
repository-code: "https://github.com/fersandovalgtz/raramuri-historico"
abstract: >-
  Machine-only historical-digital scholarly edition of Matthäus Steffel's
  Tarahumarisches Wörterbuch (1791/1809) and reference implementation of the
  reusable Rarámuri Histórico Digital (RHD) data/provenance model. The corpus
  preserves OCR, AI-assisted diplomatic/documentary layers, explicit uncertainty,
  TEI/TEI Lex-0 projections, appendices and computational diachronic candidate
  evidence. No human validation is claimed or required by this release scope.
keywords:
  - Rarámuri
  - Tarahumara
  - historical lexicography
  - digital humanities
  - indigenous languages
  - Steffel
  - TEI Lex-0
  - provenance
  - machine-only scholarly edition
